    Bug 1943639 - Handle missing collected address book gracefully. r=john.bieling

    To test, set mail.collect_addressbook to a junk value and send a message.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D235744

diff --git a/mailnews/compose/src/AddressCollector.sys.mjs b/mailnews/compose/src/AddressCollector.sys.mjs
